  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5b633d01c984e3eaee13c00a2d81131, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RoomTips
  tipText: {fileID: 1394620984}
  interval: 30
  tips:
  - Press Esc to pause. During the match intro, Esc skips it; resolution dialogs
    use Esc first.
  - "Recall camera presets with 1\u20134. Hold Shift + 1\u20134 to replace a preset
    for this Room session."
  - Press E to show or hide the side panel when no dialog is blocking play.
  - Use the arrow keys to pan the camera across the pitch.
  - Hold the left mouse button and drag to pan. A simple click still selects players
    and hexes.
  - Hold the right mouse button and drag to orbit the camera.
  - Scroll, or hold + / -, to zoom in or out.
  - Hold Ctrl + Shift + S to see shooting hexes at both ends; hold Ctrl + Shift +
    H for heading hexes.
  - Press Space over a pitch player or lineup name to inspect their card. Press Space
    again to close it.
  - While inspecting a card, camera controls and Esc remain available. CPU decisions
    and current actions continue.
